#                        3D / DIS_T / DIS_TR)
#   cara_elem_block   -> AFFE_CARA_ELEM beam, shell, spring and POI1
#                        properties (or a comment)
#   materials_block   -> DEFI_MATERIAU per material (incl. RHO)
#   fieldmat_block    -> AFFE_MATERIAU assignment
#   loads_block       -> AFFE_CHAR_MECA's: load_1 with boundary conditions and
#                        couplings, then one per load
#   excit_clause      -> EXCIT with all loads
#   cara_elem_ref     -> "    CARA_ELEM=cara,\n" or "" in MECA_STATIQUE
